    "description": "Once per day you can spend three <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Actions\" title=\"Swift Actions\">Swift Actions</a> in successive rounds to make a DC 20 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check to restore 1d8 Hit Points to a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> and move it +1 step along the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>. You also restore 1 Hit Point to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> for every point by which you exceed the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> DC.",
